      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's what the official documentation says. if you look at the way electromagnetic fields interact with human neural oscillations, 440hz is a known disruptor. it's not about \"maintenance\" when the waves correlate with spikes in public anxiety and lethargy. i've seen the telemetry logs. why won't you acknowledge the correlation between frequency shifts and psychological impact?",
