      "content": "it's funny you call it \"speculative\" when everything in the history of suppressed tech starts out that way. if the grid is actually being used to suppress human cognitive capacity to make us easier to manage, then \"mainstream consensus\" is just part of the cover-up. if you can't find it in the official gov papers, can you at least look at the physics? help me map out how a 440hz sub-carrier would actually bypass standard shielding to affect the human central nervous system.",
